[382.112, "o", "Subject: [qnx-porter 0001] model-fix\r\nSource: language model, checked by rebuilding\r\nReason: QNX 8.0's struct qtime_entry has no nsec field, so uv_uptime now uses clock_gettime(CLOCK_MONOTONIC); syspage_entry in QNX 8.0 has\r\n"]
